t="v1" itunes:key="L61"><span begin="01:48.418" end="01:49.051">愛燦燦</span> <span begin="01:49.051" end="01:49.676">春爛漫</span> <span begin="01:49.676" end="01:50.201">日々だんだん</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱灿灿 春烂漫 时光缓缓</span></p><p begin="01:50.234" end="01:51.699" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L62"><span begin="01:50.234" end="01:51.456">大事なものが消えていく</span><span begin="01:51.456" end="01:51.699">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">重要的东西渐渐消失</span></p><p begin="01:51.785" end="01:52.201" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L63"><span begin="01:51.785" end="01:52.201">さんはい</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好的</span></p><p begin="01:52.236" end="01:53.752" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L64"><span begin="01:52.236" end="01:52.889">「この世には</span><span begin="01:52.889" end="01:53.752">愛も知らない人が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“这个世界上还有很多</span></p><p begin="01:53.769" end="01:55.003" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L65"><span begin="01:53.769" end="01:54.180">沢山</span><span begin="01:54.180" end="01:54.676">いるんです</span><span begin="01:54.676" end="01:55.003">よ」</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连爱是什么都不知道的人啊”</span></p><p begin="01:55.070" end="01:55.485" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L66"><span begin="01:55.070" end="01:55.485">さんはい</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好的</span></p><p begin="01:55.485" end="01:57.033" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L67"><span begin="01:55.485" end="01:56.198">「この世には</span><span begin="01:56.198" end="01:57.033">愛も知らない人が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“这个世界上还有很多</span></p><p begin="01:57.033" end="01:58.267" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L68"><span begin="01:57.033" end="01:57.444">沢山</span><span begin="01:57.444" end="01:57.940">いるんです</span><span begin="01:57.940" end="01:58.267">よ」</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连爱是什么都不知道的人啊”</span></p><p begin="01:58.354" end="02:00.044" ttm:agent="v1" itu